                <pb facs="0818" n="723" sameAs="frus:frus1936v04/pg723"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.00/571: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-02-27T12:00:00+09:00">February 27,
                        1936—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received February 27—1:37 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>40. Department’s 25, February 26, 5 p.m. As the Minister for Foreign Affairs
                    expects to be all day in conference at the Palace, I have communicated your
                    message to his secretary who undertook to deliver it textually to Hirota this
                    morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
